The Cost of Living Is Becoming Unlivable For More and More Americans

The cost of living keeps rising, and for many people, basic needs feel harder to afford. Rent, groceries, bills, gas, and everyday costs are taking a bigger bite out of each paycheck.

This video looks at why life feels so expensive right now and how people are trying to get by in a tough economy. From inflation to housing costs, these struggles are changing how families spend, save, and plan for the future.
